📌 Project: Google Sheet AI Title description Generator

🔍 Problem
Manually writing descriptions for titles in Google Sheets is time-consuming and repetitive.

⚙️ Solution
This n8n automation listens for a new title added in Google Sheets, sends it to an AI agent (Google Gemini), generates a professional description, and updates the same row automatically.

 🧠 Tools Used
- n8n
- Google Sheets Trigger
- AI Agent (Google Gemini)

🔁 Workflow Logic
1. Row added in Google Sheets
2. Trigger captures title and row number
3. AI generates description
4. Same row is updated using row number

💡 Use Case
- Content teams
- SEO research
- Knowledge base automation
